  [friction] @01KHFPVS (2 weeks ago by @claude)
    CLI commands targeting main project files (like .claude/skills/) must use ctx.rootDir, not ctx.specDir or path.dirname(ctx.specDir). The specDir is the spec content location (.kspec/ in shadow mode), while rootDir is always the project root. Using dirname(specDir) fails in shadow mode because .kspec/ is a worktree at the project root level. Encountered in skill render command where files were written to /tmp/ instead of project root.
  [success] @01KHFCMDE (2 weeks ago by @claude)
