  [friction] @01KHCYW7 (2 weeks ago by @claude)
    Commander.js parent-action option routing: when parent and subcommands define the same options, Commander doesn't cleanly route them. Tried passThroughOptions (requires global enablePositionalOptions, breaks --json global option), ended up using allowUnknownOption + temporary Command re-parse. Pattern works but is non-idiomatic. If more command groups need default actions, consider extracting this into a shared utility.
